  },
  "required_fix": "Schedule each real cached NoteColumnRenderer in the production live update plan after its NoteField ActorFrame update, using the native NoteField delta. Retain named/sequence child semantics; native column renderers are a special owned vector. Handle lazy column creation and plan invalidation, paused/hibernated ownership, update rates and repeated field lookups without double advancement. Add production-path controls before the last allowed full repair, which must reuse the retained capture.",
